{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a4582099-d84b-8b55-8dc8-1c0f5ba0a787",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:24:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a business license. I want to open a small shop. A small shop. [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry, you cut out a little. A small shop, you said? What kind of shop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Retail. Selling home goods, mostly. Home goods, mostly. And I'm on speaker, so tell me if it's bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a little choppy but I can hear you. For retail you'd generally fill out a business license application with the clerk's office. Depending on the space, there may be other approvals too, like zoning or a certificate from the building side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Other approvals. Okay. And how do I know which ones I need? Which ones I need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the location and what you're selling. If you give me the street address of the shop, I can point you to the right office. Do you have one yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. I live on Dean Avenue, 281, but the shop's not there. Not there. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Once you have a location, check with zoning first. The license application itself you can pick up here or get from the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what's the fee? What's the fee for the license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies by type of business, so I don't want to throw out a number that's wrong. The staff here will tell you the exact amount when you submit the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:23:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So I'd have to come in to find out. Come in to find out. Okay. What do I bring? What do I bring with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring a photo ID, the completed application, the business name and address, and if you have a lease or proof of the location, bring that. Also any state paperwork if you've registered the business already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:24:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photo ID, application, address, lease, state paperwork. Did I get that right? Get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. We're open weekdays during regular hours, so come in whenever suits you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. That's what I needed. What I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:24:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good luck with the shop. Drive safe in the rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T14:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
